  "answer_text": "Here's a roundup of the **best laptop deals online right now** across various categories and budgets:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfc6 Best Laptop Deals Online (June 2026)\n\n### \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Where to Shop\nYou can find all kinds of deals across a wide range of online retailers such as **Newegg, Walmart, Best Buy, Amazon**, and so on. It's also worth checking out deals directly from laptop manufacturers like **Lenovo, HP, and Dell**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcbc Best All-Around Laptop\n**Lenovo Yoga (2-in-1)**\nFeaturing a **14-inch 2880\u00d71800 OLED display** with HDR at up to 120Hz, the Lenovo Yoga is powered by an **Intel Core Ultra 7 258V CPU**, **32GB of RAM**, a **1TB SSD**, and Intel Arc 140V graphics. It weighs under three pounds, the battery lasts up to **23 hours**, and its **2-in-1 form factor** lets you flip it around for use as a tablet or prop it up like a tent.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcb0 Best Budget Laptop\n**Dell 15 Laptop**\nNeed an affordable laptop for the basics? The **Dell 15 Laptop** is a top pick \u2014 its **AMD Ryzen 3 7320U** chip is well-suited for daily tasks like browsing, streaming, and email.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfae Best Gaming Laptop Deals\nAn **RTX 5060 Lenovo gaming laptop** is one of the best deals of the week, featuring an **OLED display**, **Ultra 7 chipset**, **32GB of RAM**, and **$400 off**.\n\nOther notable gaming deals at **Best Buy** include:\n- **ASUS ROG Zephyrus G16** \u2013 16\" 2.5K OLED, 240Hz, Intel Core Ultra 9 285H, 16GB RAM, NVIDIA RTX 5070, 1TB SSD\n- **ASUS ROG Zephyrus G14** \u2013 14\" 3K OLED, 120Hz, AMD Ryzen AI 9 HX 370, 32GB RAM, NVIDIA RTX 5070 Ti, 1TB SSD\n- **Lenovo Legion Pro 5** \u2013 16\" 2.5K, AMD Ryzen 9 8945HX, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060, 16GB Memory, 1TB SSD\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf10 Best Chromebook Deals\nChromebooks make great everyday machines because they're designed for browsing the web and checking email, use fewer resources, and are generally **more affordable** than Windows laptops. Some top picks at Best Buy include:\n- **Acer Chromebook 315** \u2013 15.6\" FHD with Google AI\n- **HP 14\" 2-in-1 Chromebook** \u2013 Intel Core N150, 8GB Memory\n- **Lenovo Chromebook Plus** \u2013 15.3\" 2K Touchscreen, Intel Core 3\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf4e Best MacBook Deals\nYou can save **up to $300** on the **Apple MacBook Air** \u2014 with deals on both the **M4 and M5** models available right now.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Buying Tips\n- Aim for at least **8GB of RAM**, though **16GB is preferable**, especially if you play games.\n- Whether you're looking for an affordable Windows machine **under $500**, a blazing-fast gaming beast, or a portable **2-in-1** for school or work, there are plenty of great choices right now.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd17 Best Sites to Check Daily\n| Retailer | Link |\n|---|---|\n| **Best Buy** | [bestbuy.com](https://www.bestbuy.com) |\n| **HP Store** | [hp.com](https://www.hp.com/us-en/shop/slp/weekly-deals/laptops) |\n| **PCWorld Deals** | [pcworld.com](https://www.pcworld.com/article/550968/best-laptop-deals-3.html) |\n| **TechRadar Deals** | [techradar.com](https://www.techradar.com/news/the-best-laptop-deals) |\n| **BestLaptop.deals** | [bestlaptop.deals](https://www.bestlaptop.deals) |\n\nCheck these sites regularly, as deals are updated **daily**! \ud83c\udf89",
